---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Newsletter from '../components/Newsletter.astro';
import { mailto } from '../site';
---
<Base description="Agile training and coaching services. Deliver value to your customers faster, with fewer headaches and of higher quality.">
  <section class="hero">
    <img src="/images/08bb11-recurvise-loop-homepage-web-res-v2.jpg" alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="wrap hero-inner">
      <h1>Together, we’ll ignite a spark, unbridling your organisation’s creativity and potential.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Deliver value to your customers faster, with fewer headaches and of higher quality with our agile training and services.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Flow insights</p>
      <h2>See how work really moves through your organisation.</h2>
      <p class="lede prose">Most organisations can see what goes in and what comes out, but not the machine in between. That is where capacity disappears.</p>
      <p class="prose">We build custom insights solutions from the delivery data you already produce, so leaders can see where work waits, what that waiting costs, and which change would move it most. No new platform to adopt, and no scorecard on your people: we model the system, not the individuals in it.</p>
      <ul class="methods">
        <li><strong>Flow metrics, read as signals.</strong> Lead time, waiting time, work in progress and predictability, drawn from the tools you already use and read as diagnostic signals rather than targets.</li>
        <li><strong>Measurement that reduces uncertainty.</strong> We measure only what would change a decision. Small samples, calibrated estimates and Bayesian updating tell you more than a dashboard full of vanity metrics.</li>
        <li><strong>Forecasts you can defend.</strong> Delivery forecasts built from your own history, with the uncertainty stated plainly instead of hidden behind a single date.</li>
        <li><strong>Dependencies and flow economics.</strong> Where work queues against shared teams, and what that delay costs in capacity, so interventions can be ranked by leverage before budget is committed.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href={mailto('Flow insights enquiry')}>Talk to us about flow insights</a>
        <a class="textlink" href="/insights">Read our thinking on measurement</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section light">
    <div class="wrap row">
      <img src="/images/25be6f-recursive-loop-gen-image-home.jpg" alt="Workshop participants collaborating around a table" loading="lazy" />
      <div>
        <h2>Agile services</h2>
        <p>Through our agile services, your teams are empowered to adjust to changing requirements nimbly and efficiently, all while ensuring continuous delivery flow. Our services promote the reduction of technical debt, enhancement of customer satisfaction, and delivery of top-notch products.</p>
        <p>Explore our Re:Agile training classes.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/classes">Let’s go</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section dark">
    <div class="wrap row">
      <div>
        <h2>Stay up to date</h2>
        <p class="lede">Sign up for Re:Agile News</p>
        <Newsletter />
      </div>
      <img src="/images/11fe58-recurvise-loop-signup-web-res.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; background: var(--dark); color: var(--white); min-height: 520px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .hero > img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: .55; }
  .hero-inner { position: relative; padding-top: clamp(64px, 10vw, 140px); padding-bottom: clamp(64px, 10vw, 140px); }
  .hero h1 { max-width: 14em; }
  .hero .lede { max-width: 34em; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: .6em; }
  .methods { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1.6em 0 2em; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px 40px; }
  .methods li { margin: 0; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 2px solid var(--line); font-size: .98rem; }
  .methods strong { display: block; margin-bottom: .25em; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 16px 28px; }
  .textlink { font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .textlink:hover { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .dark :global(.field input) { border-color: #3a3936; background: #1a1917; color: var(--dark-ink); }
</style>
